cale.com>","parents":[{"sha":"7e80372a695d892f98fdf5ec453a9856cd6b00a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/7e80372a695d892f98fdf5ec453a9856cd6b00a8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/7e80372a695d892f98fdf5ec453a9856cd6b00a8"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDkLeCFLjeKnweEiEqh1O1vMVTnso1SUKK41owSEEFcMq2z4yNkioX5vrL5IHc+LRg\ndrIUclJo6MeMyqWaY5QAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 5eaca372930c328557cb4419b7fc4a71f0c123cc\nparent 7e80372a695d892f98fdf5ec453a9856cd6b00a8\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762003679 +0100\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762076299 +0100\n\nmatcher: Add func for comparing Dests and TheInternet\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>\n","verified_at":"2025-11-02T09:38:23Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"f24746782e1da9fdbf0a7b3c115f959f077c14c1","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGYyNDc0Njc4MmUxZGE5ZmRiZjBhN2IzYzExNWY5NTlmMDc3YzE0YzE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f24746782e1da9fdbf0a7b3c115f959f077c14c1","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f24746782e1da9fdbf0a7b3c115f959f077c14c1","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-01T13:29:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-02T09:38:19Z"},"tree":{"sha":"1b3b831838b9910da5829145d5302d1527ca4083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/1b3b831838b9910da5829145d5302d1527ca4083"},"message":"types: Distinguish subnet and exit node access\n\nWhen we fixed the issue of node visibility of nodes\nthat only had access to eachother because of a subnet\nroute, we gave all nodes access to all exit routes by\naccident.\n\nThis commit splits exit nodes and subnet routes in the\naccess.\n\nIf a matcher indicates that the node should have access to\nany part of the subnet routes, we do not remove it from the\nnode list.\n\nIf a matcher destination is equal to the internet, and the\ntarget node is an exit node, we also do not remove the access.\n\nFixes #2784\nFixes #2788\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>","parents":[{"sha":"fe9060eaf28ff573d358cf676f5e7a799c502b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/fe9060eaf28ff573d358cf676f5e7a799c502b79","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/fe9060eaf28ff573d358cf676f5e7a799c502b79"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP7K94PkjEmcYc1tYXvxKCD0hF7nRBBTQ0FRasRLuSdh+MaICYn77e34KfIh25hNgQ\nXCEqxwrTukeV4tBdtvgQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 1b3b831838b9910da5829145d5302d1527ca4083\nparent fe9060eaf28ff573d358cf676f5e7a799c502b79\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762003790 +0100\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762076299 +0100\n\ntypes: Distinguish subnet and exit node access\n\nWhen we fixed the issue of node visibility of nodes\nthat only had access to eachother because of a subnet\nroute, we gave all nodes access to all exit routes by\naccident.\n\nThis commit splits exit nodes and subnet routes in the\naccess.\n\nIf a matcher indicates that the node should have access to\nany part of the subnet routes, we do not remove it from the\nnode list.\n\nIf a matcher destination is equal to the internet, and the\ntarget node is an exit node, we also do not remove the access.\n\nFixes #2784\nFixes #2788\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>\n","verified_at":"2025-11-02T09:38:23Z"